# UNLOCK — AI

Use only for AI/content-generation work.

Guardrails:
- AI is not the real-time Learning Engine;
- grading/mastery/misconception/NBA/Today state must remain deterministic trusted logic;
- AI-generated content should be reviewable before publication;
- preserve provider boundaries and cost discipline;
- do not implement speculative AI architecture before an accepted product/design decision;
- Structured Import precedes native PDF/AI ingestion in the current roadmap.

Canonical decision: ADR-004 plus current roadmap/AI design when available.
